  ✓ Design fused D8/2 + D16/2 behavior and map it to solver/generator invariants
  ✓ Implement new code at ceshi/code_combo/cb2d8a2c/37/code.py with analysis comments and updated docstring
  ✓ Run generation/solver tests, debug failures, and measure fusion-behavior metrics
